scan of <root>
add   shop.test      127.0.1.1
add   api.shop.test  127.0.1.1
add   web.shop.test  127.0.1.1  port 3001
link  ./docker/compose.dev.yaml · DOCKER_HOST_IP=127.0.1.1 in its .env
set   apps/web/.env:1
      - API_URL=http://localhost:3001
      + API_URL=http://web.shop.test
set   apps/web/.env:2
      - DATABASE_URL=postgres://***@localhost:5432/shop
      + DATABASE_URL=postgres://***@shop.test:5432/shop
note  api.shop.test: lodo can't tell its port; set it in lodo dev --edit

run lodo dev --edit here to add, link and set these
